# Long Night across the scenes: one long render to listen to across two handovers, and the other two handovers
# as short files; a picture on either side of each (not a test). From Crypt's door: night.wav runs from two minutes
# before Crypt gives way to Night Sky, through Night Sky's whole half-hour round, to two minutes into Forest Ruins
# (34 minutes; the handovers are at 1:59.8 and 31:59.8). Then four minutes round each of the other two:
# night-ruins-lake.wav and night-lake-crypt.wav, the handover at 1:59.8 of each. The files are 24 dB louder than the
# simulator's output (wavgain); the peak check is on the output itself.
#   tools\docker_run.ps1 build/host/crawl_host tools/night.zen build/host
wait 800
wavgain 24
spin PRESET 1
wait 150
spin PRESET 1
wait 150
spin PRESET 1
wait 1500
expect scene 3
expect night 1
nightleft 120000
peakreset
wav night.wav
nightleft 6000
shot night-crypt-before.png
wait 16000
expect passes 1
shot night-sky-after.png
nightleft 6000
shot night-sky-before.png
wait 16000
expect passes 2
shot night-ruins-after.png
wait 110000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -27
nightleft 120000
peakreset
wav night-ruins-lake.wav
nightleft 6000
shot night-ruins-before.png
wait 16000
expect passes 3
shot night-lake-after.png
wait 110000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -27
nightleft 120000
peakreset
wav night-lake-crypt.wav
nightleft 6000
shot night-lake-before.png
wait 16000
expect passes 4
shot night-crypt-after.png
wait 110000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -27
expect showing 3
expect guest 0
